  {
    "_comments": [
      "Read on the form itself. The automation runtime loads the Form to dispatch against its published snapshot, so without this EVERY automation fails on a fresh install with 'Does NOT have permission to Read MJ_BizApps_Forms: Forms records' -- the response is saved and every side effect is skipped. Found by smoke:binding the first time the shipped role was used instead of one the smoke fixture had over-granted."
    ],
